          ╭─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
          │ igris 1.2.0 is out                                                                              │
          │                                                                                                 │
          │ 1.1.0 → 1.2.0 · igris can't tell how it was installed, so it runs nothing.                      │
          │ https://github.com/drilonrecica/igris/releases/tag/v1.2.0                                       │
          │ Download, verify and install it by hand:                                                        │
          │   curl -fsSLO                                                                                   │
          │   https://github.com/drilonrecica/igris/releases/download/v1.2.0/igris_1.2.0_linux_amd64.tar.gz │
          │   curl -fsSLO https://github.com/drilonrecica/igris/releases/download/v1.2.0/checksums.txt      │
          │   curl -fsSLO https://github.com/drilonrecica/igris/releases/download/v1.2.0/checksums.txt.sig  │
          │   curl -fsSLO https://raw.githubusercontent.com/drilonrecica/igris/v1.2.0/allowed_signers       │
          │   ssh-keygen -Y verify -f allowed_signers -I igris -n file -s checksums.txt.sig < checksums.txt │
          │   sha256sum --ignore-missing -c checksums.txt                                                   │
          │   tar xzf igris_1.2.0_linux_amd64.tar.gz                                                        │
          │   install -m 755 igris /home/u/.local/bin/igris                                                 │
          │   igris version                                                                                 │
          │ The ssh-keygen line must print Good "file" signature for igris.                                 │
          │                                                                                                 │
          │ › 1. Copy steps (y)                                                                             │
          │   2. Close                                                                                      │
